     1224   DEFINE BUTTON button-prod
     1225        IMAGE-UP FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
     1226        IMAGE-DOWN FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
     1227        IMAGE-INSENSITIVE FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
