     1307   PROCEDURE adm-show-errors :
     1308       DEFINE VARIABLE        cntr                  AS INTEGER   NO-UNDO.
     1309       DO cntr = 1 TO ERROR-STATUS:NUM-MESSAGES:
     1310           MESSAGE ERROR-STATUS:GET-MESSAGE(cntr).
     1311       END.
     1312       RETURN.
     1313   END PROCEDURE.
     1314   PROCEDURE adm-UIB-mode :
