     1408   PROCEDURE init-object :
     1409     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER  p-proc-name   AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.
     1410     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER  p-parent-hdl  AS HANDLE    NO-UNDO.
